ets/steam/apps/3655760/extras/2eb291cf8f31dc56804a949c614648a0.mp4?t=1747439350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your babies grow, get to know each of their unique personalities and strengthen the bonds of your family. Talk with other groundhogs and even other species of animals to build unique friendships, exchange culture, and foster a sense of belonging. Be careful though, as not everyone you meet will want to be your friend. You get to choose who you interact with and how you interact with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655760/extras/386faa314dcc1c8431a66dba20bb63ec.poster.avif?t=1747439350\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655760/extras/386faa314dcc1c8431a66dba20bb63ec.webm?t=1747439350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655760/extras/386faa314dcc1c8431a66dba20bb63ec.mp4?t=1747439350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few square kilometers is a big place when you're a groundhog. Though you may never see the other side of that highway, there are many unique places to explore, including the meadowlands surrounding your burrow, a lush forest, a farm full of vegetables and fruits, a swamp full of frogs, and much more. Collect interesting items as you explore, and bring them back home to decorate your burrow or give to friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655760/extras/f9f997dabca0b233159e097e191d8a06.poster.avif?t=1747439350\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655760/extras/f9f997dabca0b233159e097e191d8a06.webm?t=1747439350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655760/extras/f9f997dabca0b233159e097e191d8a06.mp4?t=1747439350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle:</strong> Experience a dynamic day/night cycle with stunning skies and shifting weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many Ways To Play:</strong> Engage in whatever level of combat, survival elements, and narrative you'd like. Customizable difficulty settings and skippable dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter:</strong> The way you interact with the creatures and world around you can have a profound impact on the ending of the game and the path that leads you there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles:</strong> Explore a large open world to find all kinds of nifty knickknacks and thingamajigs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Controls:</strong> Play with mouse and keyboard or any gamepad controller with standard Xbox, Nintendo, or PlayStation button layouts. Supports button remapping.</p></li></ul>",
